From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 23:40:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: drop dead cloud_api_client stubs + dangling onboarding
 keybindings

Residual dead surface left by earlier strips, removed now that the
verify gate actually runs:

- cloud_api_client.rs: delete update_system_settings and
  submit_edit_prediction_feedback. Both are callerless no-op stubs
  (return CloudDisabled / Ok). The kept methods (get_authenticated_user,
  create_llm_token feeding LlmApiToken, submit_agent_feedback, etc.)
  retain live callers and stay. All cloud_api_types re-exports are
  preserved.
- assets/keymaps/default-{linux,macos,windows}.json: remove the
  onboarding::SignIn and onboarding::OpenAccount keybindings. Patch 0020
  removed both actions but left these six bindings dangling. The
  onboarding::Finish binding above each is still valid and stays.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 assets/keymaps/default-linux.json               |  2 --
 assets/keymaps/default-macos.json               |  2 --
 assets/keymaps/default-windows.json             |  2 --
 crates/cloud_api_client/src/cloud_api_client.rs | 15 ---------------
 4 files changed, 21 deletions(-)

